#: source/how-to/transfer_policies_between_physx_and_newton.rst:4
msgid "Transfer Policies Between PhysX and Newton"
msgstr "在 PhysX 和 Newton 之间迁移策略"

#: source/how-to/transfer_policies_between_physx_and_newton.rst:8
msgid ""
"This guide is the source of truth for the ``isaaclab-transferring-policies-"
"sim-to-sim`` agent skill (`skill source <../../../skills/user/isaaclab-"
"transferring-policies-sim-to-sim/SKILL.md>`__). When you change this page, "
"update the skill so agent guidance stays in sync. See "
":doc:`/source/developer-tools/agent_skills`."
msgstr ""
"本指南是 ``isaaclab-transferring-policies-sim-to-sim`` 智能体技能的权威参考（ `技能源文件 "
"<../../../skills/user/isaaclab-transferring-policies-sim-to-sim/SKILL.md>`__"
" ）。修改本页时，也应更新该技能，使智能体指导保持一致。参见 :doc:`/source/developer-tools/agent_skills` 。"

#: source/how-to/transfer_policies_between_physx_and_newton.rst:15
msgid ""
"First make every robot and object MJWarp-clean by following "
":doc:`/source/how-to/prepare_asset_for_newton` and the ``isaaclab-preparing-"
"assets-for-newton`` `skill <https://github.com/isaac-"
"sim/IsaacLab/blob/develop/skills/user/prepare-assets-for-"
"newton/SKILL.md>`__."
msgstr ""
"先按 :doc:`/source/how-to/prepare_asset_for_newton` 和 ``isaaclab-preparing-"
"assets-for-newton`` `技能 <https://github.com/isaac-"
"sim/IsaacLab/blob/develop/skills/user/prepare-assets-for-newton/SKILL.md>`__"
" 的说明，确保每个机器人和物体都符合 MJWarp 要求。"

#: source/how-to/transfer_policies_between_physx_and_newton.rst:21
msgid ""
"Sim-to-sim transfer evaluates one policy checkpoint in a physics backend "
"different from the one used for training. This guide covers both PhysX-"
"trained policies deployed in Newton and Newton-trained policies deployed in "
"PhysX."
msgstr ""
"仿真间迁移是在不同于训练所用的物理后端中评估同一策略检查点。本指南同时介绍将 PhysX 训练策略部署到 Newton，以及将 Newton "
"训练策略部署到 PhysX。"

#: source/how-to/transfer_policies_between_physx_and_newton.rst:25
msgid ""
"The checkpoint maps ordered observations to actions; it does not include the"
" physics engine. Transfer works when both backends expose the same policy "
"inputs and outputs. Expect similar behavior, not identical trajectories. "
"Successful transfer can be a first step toward sim-to-real deployment."
msgstr ""
"检查点将有序观测映射到动作，不包含物理引擎。两个后端提供相同策略输入和输出时，才能迁移。应期待相近行为，而非完全相同的轨迹。成功迁移可以是迈向仿真到现实部署的第一步。"

#: source/how-to/transfer_policies_between_physx_and_newton.rst:32
msgid "Task readiness and checkpoint compatibility"
msgstr "任务准备与检查点兼容性"

#: source/how-to/transfer_policies_between_physx_and_newton.rst:34
msgid ""
"The same registered task should describe the same Markov decision process "
"(MDP) in both physics engines. Selecting ``physics=isaacsim_physx`` or "
"``physics=newton_mjwarp`` resolves a backend alternative through "
":class:`~isaaclab_tasks.utils.PresetCfg`. Use that mechanism for intentional"
" backend-specific physics, asset, and control configuration. A physics "
"preset should not silently change policy-facing action, observation, reward,"
" termination, command, or reset terms. If a ``PresetCfg`` used by an MDP "
"term does select different behavior, treat the resolved configurations as "
"different tasks: restore one checkpoint contract or retrain for the new "
"contract."
msgstr ""
"同一注册任务应在两个物理引擎中描述相同的马尔可夫决策过程（MDP）。选择 ``physics=isaacsim_physx`` 或 "
"``physics=newton_mjwarp`` ，会通过 :class:`~isaaclab_tasks.utils.PresetCfg` "
"解析对应后端选项。应通过该机制配置有意区分后端的物理、资产和控制设置。物理预设不应静默改变策略侧的动作、观测、奖励、终止、指令或重置项。如果 MDP "
"项使用的 ``PresetCfg`` 确实选择了不同的行为，应将解析后配置视为不同任务：恢复统一的检查点接口约定，或根据新约定重新训练。"

#: source/how-to/transfer_policies_between_physx_and_newton.rst:42
msgid ""
"Before attempting transfer, ensure that the same task can be trained "
"successfully in both engines. Then resolve each backend configuration and "
"audit the policy interface. The following values must match exactly:"
msgstr "尝试迁移前，确认同一任务可在两个引擎中成功训练。然后解析各后端配置，检查策略接口。以下值必须完全一致："

#: source/how-to/transfer_policies_between_physx_and_newton.rst:50
msgid "Contract"
msgstr "约定"

#: source/how-to/transfer_policies_between_physx_and_newton.rst:51
msgid "Required equality"
msgstr "必须一致的内容"

