msgid ""
"For Allegro transfer, contact stiffness (``ke``), contact damping (``kd``), "
"contact friction, joint damping, and joint friction are the key parameters "
"to tune. Increasing solver substeps to 4–16 significantly improves contact "
"stability during in-hand manipulation."
