"4–16，可显著提高手内操作的接触稳定性。"

#: source/how-to/transfer_policies_between_physx_and_newton.rst:326
msgid "Joint and body ordering"
msgstr "关节与刚体顺序"

#: source/how-to/transfer_policies_between_physx_and_newton.rst:328
msgid ""
"PhysX and MJWarp may order an articulation's joints and bodies differently. "
"Set ``joint_ordering`` and ``body_ordering`` to keep names mapped to the "
"same tensor elements across backends. This section explains the supported "
"conventions, conversion costs, and direct backend-view access. For backend "
"selection and capabilities, see :ref:`physics-backends`."
msgstr ""
"PhysX 和 MJWarp 对同一关节系统的关节与刚体排序可能不同。设置 ``joint_ordering`` 和 "
"``body_ordering``，可以让各后端中的名称对应相同的张量元素。本节介绍支持的排序约定、转换开销和直接访问后端视图的方法。后端选择及功能支持见"
" :ref:`physics-backends` 。"

#: source/how-to/transfer_policies_between_physx_and_newton.rst:335
msgid "Why articulation orders differ"
msgstr "关节系统的排序为何不同"

#: source/how-to/transfer_policies_between_physx_and_newton.rst:337
msgid ""
"Three facts explain why a checkpoint can need an ordering convention even "
"when both backends load the same USD asset:"
msgstr "即使两个后端加载相同的 USD 资源，检查点仍可能需要指定顺序约定，原因如下："

#: source/how-to/transfer_policies_between_physx_and_newton.rst:340
msgid ""
"USD names identify physical joints and bodies, but they do not impose one "
"universal tensor-axis order across solvers."
msgstr "USD 名称标识物理关节和刚体，但不会规定各求解器必须采用相同的张量轴顺序。"

#: source/how-to/transfer_policies_between_physx_and_newton.rst:342
msgid ""
"PhysX and MJWarp construct native articulation views with different topology"
" traversal and internal representation choices."
msgstr "PhysX 与 MJWarp 采用不同的拓扑遍历和内部表示方式，构建原生关节体视图。"

#: source/how-to/transfer_policies_between_physx_and_newton.rst:344
msgid ""
"Isaac Lab resolves the requested names once during articulation "
"initialization, then exposes the selected public order through its high-"
"level API."
msgstr "Isaac Lab 在关节体初始化时解析一次所请求的名称，之后通过高层 API 暴露选定的公共顺序。"

#: source/how-to/transfer_policies_between_physx_and_newton.rst:348
msgid ""
"The backend selection described in :ref:`backend-architecture` controls "
"which native view is created. The ordering selection controls how the high-"
"level API presents that view."
msgstr ":ref:`backend-architecture` 中介绍的后端选择决定创建哪一种原生视图；顺序选择决定高层 API 如何呈现该视图。"

#: source/how-to/transfer_policies_between_physx_and_newton.rst:354
msgid "Public and backend order"
msgstr "公共接口顺序与后端顺序"

#: source/how-to/transfer_policies_between_physx_and_newton.rst:356
msgid ""
"Set ``joint_ordering`` and ``body_ordering`` on "
":class:`~isaaclab.assets.ArticulationCfg`. Each field accepts one of:"
msgstr ""
"在 :class:`~isaaclab.assets.ArticulationCfg` 中设置 ``joint_ordering`` 和 "
"``body_ordering`` 。各字段接受以下任一值："

#: source/how-to/transfer_policies_between_physx_and_newton.rst:359
msgid ""
"``None`` -- backend-native order and the zero-conversion default (see "
"below)."
msgstr "``None`` ：后端原生顺序，也是无需转换的默认值，详见下文。"

#: source/how-to/transfer_policies_between_physx_and_newton.rst:360
msgid "``\"physx\"`` -- PhysX or OVPhysX articulation-view order."
msgstr "``\"physx\"`` ：PhysX 或 OVPhysX 关节体视图顺序。"

#: source/how-to/transfer_policies_between_physx_and_newton.rst:361
msgid "``\"mjwarp\"`` -- Newton or MJWarp articulation-view order."
msgstr "``\"mjwarp\"`` ：Newton 或 MJWarp 关节体视图顺序。"

#: source/how-to/transfer_policies_between_physx_and_newton.rst:362
msgid ""
"``\"robot_schema\"`` -- the order authored on the asset's "
"``isaac:physics:robotJoints`` (joints) or ``isaac:physics:robotLinks`` "
"(bodies) relationships."
msgstr ""
"``\"robot_schema\"`` ：资源的 ``isaac:physics:robotJoints`` （关节）或 "
"``isaac:physics:robotLinks`` （刚体）关系中定义的顺序。"

#: source/how-to/transfer_policies_between_physx_and_newton.rst:365
msgid ""
"an explicit, complete name permutation -- a ``list`` or ``tuple`` naming "
"every joint or body exactly once."
msgstr "显式、完整的名称排列：一个 ``list`` 或 ``tuple`` ，恰好包含每个关节或刚体的名称一次。"

#: source/how-to/transfer_policies_between_physx_and_newton.rst:368
msgid ""
"See :attr:`~isaaclab.assets.ArticulationCfg.joint_ordering` for the "
"authoritative list of accepted values."
msgstr "准确的可接受值列表见 :attr:`~isaaclab.assets.ArticulationCfg.joint_ordering` 。"

#: source/how-to/transfer_policies_between_physx_and_newton.rst:371
msgid ""
"For Python configs, prefer "
":func:`~isaaclab.assets.apply_articulation_ordering_preset` to set both "
"fields to the same convention in a single call, which keeps joint and body "
"order consistent:"
msgstr ""
"在 Python 配置中，优先使用 "
":func:`~isaaclab.assets.apply_articulation_ordering_preset` "
"，一次调用将两个字段设置为相同约定，使关节与刚体顺序保持一致："

#: source/how-to/transfer_policies_between_physx_and_newton.rst:383
msgid ""
"When overriding from the CLI or Hydra, set **both** ``joint_ordering`` and "
"``body_ordering``. Setting only ``joint_ordering`` silently leaves bodies in"
" backend order, which mismatches a checkpoint whose body vectors follow the "
"source convention."
msgstr ""
"通过 CLI 或 Hydra 覆盖配置时， **同时设置** ``joint_ordering`` 和 ``body_ordering`` 。只设置 "
"``joint_ordering`` 会让刚体仍保持后端顺序，且不会提示；如果检查点的刚体向量遵循源后端约定，就会产生不匹配。"

