#: source/how-to/transfer_policies_between_physx_and_newton.rst:596
msgid ""
"Compare public ``joint_names`` and ``body_names`` with "
"``backend_joint_names`` and ``backend_body_names``."
msgstr ""
"比较公共 ``joint_names`` 、 ``body_names`` 与 ``backend_joint_names`` 、 "
"``backend_body_names`` 。"

